## Run

```bash
pnpm build                                        # library first (turbo orders it)
pnpm --filter @m3l-automation/__SCRIPT_NAME__ start
```

`start` runs `node --env-file-if-exists=.env dist/main.js`, so a local
`scripts/__SCRIPT_NAME__/.env` is loaded automatically when present.

